# cPanel > Cron Jobs — runs the ingest/classify/scan pipeline.
# The systemd timer in this folder (adradar-pipeline.timer) is the VPS
# equivalent; on shared hosting cron is the only scheduler available.
#
# Replace USERNAME with your cPanel username and adradar with the app
# root you chose. Get the exact venv path from "Setup Python App" — the
# page shows a "source /home/USERNAME/virtualenv/.../activate" command;
# the python binary sits in that same bin/ folder.
#
# Every 12 hours (00:00 and 12:00), matching adradar-pipeline.timer:

0 */12 * * * /home/USERNAME/virtualenv/adradar/3.11/bin/python /home/USERNAME/adradar/main.py pipeline >> /home/USERNAME/adradar/pipeline.log 2>&1
